OL,3,GNEWSACharity launches #1m bid to fund
OL,4,Arespiratory unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FA charity supporting hospitals in
OL,7,FShropshire has launched a #1m appeal to
OL,8,Fhelp pay for specialist equipment for a
OL,9,Fnew respiratory centre.
OL,11,FThe Friends of Shrewsbury and Telford
OL,12,FHospital said the Breathing Life
OL,13,Fcampaign would support a dedicated
OL,14,FRespiratory Centre at Telford's
OL,15,FPrincess Royal Hospital, which is due
OL,16,Fto open in spring 2029.
OL,18,FThe latest equipment will include
OL,19,Fmachines to improve diagnosis and to
OL,20,Fhelp shorten hospital stays.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
