OL,3,GNEWSACharity launches #1m bid to fund
OL,4,Arespiratory unit
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Shrewsbury and Telford Hospital
OL,7,FTrust said the new centre would also
OL,8,Fbring specialist assessment, diagnosis
OL,9,Fand treatment together under one roof
OL,10,Ffor patients from Shropshire, Telford
OL,11,Fand Wrekin, and Mid Wales.
